   3.2. Reproduction, copying or distribution in any form.
   3.3. Modification, incorporation of any fragment into other works, or
        creation of derivative works.
   3.4. Transfer of rights, sublicensing, sale or rental.
   3.5. Use of the Software or any part of it to train machine-learning
        models or to build datasets.
   3.6. Removal or alteration of authorship notices or of this license.

4. Contributions

   The terms on which third-party changes are accepted are set out in
